  "description": "The Razor is a sporty and comfortable aluminium frame road bike with an updated 2021 frame.\n\nWhether you’re looking for a dependable Aluminium road bike for training or commuting, or you first road bike, the Razor delivers on all fronts. Featuring an all new modern looking 6061-T6 Double Butted aluminium frame and full UD T-700 carbon fork with tapered steerer, the Razor gives you the perfect balance of low weight, speed, excellent handling and comfort.\n\nFeaturing Shimano's efficient and reliable Claris R2000 8 speed drivetrain. It has Tektro R317 rim brakes, and Vitus 700c road wheels, paired with the classy looking Vee Road Runner 700c x 28 tyres offering great performance and grip in all conditions.\n\nVitus women's specific aluminium handlebars and stem, are paired with an aluminium seatpost and Vitus women's road saddle. With the addition of dual bottle mounts and full mudguard mounts for front and rear, this really is a bike that can ride whatever the conditions.\n\nLightweight aluminium frame\n\nFull UD T-700 carbon fork\n\nTapered head tube & fork steerer\n\nInternal cable routing\n\nShimano Claris R2000 Drivetrain\n\nVitus wheels and Vee Road runner 28mm tyres",
